# ChatGPT context sync (docs only)

When the user wants to **refresh ChatGPT**, **update alona-iot**, or **sync AGENTS.md to ChatGPT**:

1. Run **`/sync-chatgpt-context`** (`.cursor/commands/sync-chatgpt-context.md`).
2. Execute: `./scripts/sync-chatgpt-context.sh --zip --open`
3. Bundle is **docs only** — never add `.ex`, `.exs`, config, migrations, or tests to the manifest.

Upload `memory/chatgpt/alona-iot/` or `memory/chatgpt/alona-iot.zip` into project **alona-iot**. Remove stale uploads that contained source code.

Details: `scripts/README-chatgpt-sync.md`, `memory/README.md`.
